      arm  evals  ROUNDS  widest plate  mean regret   batch structure
      doe     48       3            27       0.0958   stage1 20 + stage2 27 + confirmation 1, each one plate
      lhs     48       1            48       0.1270   all 48 points known before the first plate
    coord     48      48             1       0.1420   one measurement at a time by definition
  qlognei     48      10            14       0.1532   opening 14, then 9 batches of q=4
   qlogei     48      10            14       0.1553   opening 14, then 9 batches of q=4
    sobol     48       1            48       0.1724   all 48 points known before the first plate
